---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>gatemoss — phishing email analysis</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A working notebook on phishing email analysis." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="topbar" id="topbar">
      <div class="devstrip">
        <div class="shell devstrip__inner">
          <span class="devstrip__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>Site in development — all sample data shown is fictional</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary">
        <div class="shell nav__inner">
          <a class="wordmark" href="#top">gatemoss</a>

          <div class="nav__links" id="navLinks">
            <span class="nav__pill" id="navPill" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            {
              nav.map((item) => (
                <a class="nav__link" href={`#${item.id}`} data-nav={item.id}>
                  {item.label}
                </a>
              ))
            }
          </div>

          <a class="btn" href="#samples">See a sample</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="shell" id="top">
      <main>
        <section class="hero" id="overview">
          <div class="hero__text">
            <p class="eyebrow">Phishing email analysis</p>
            <h1>
              This is a Security Research Project im working on. <em> <br /> Where hostile mail<br />
              gets taken apart.</em>
            </h1>
            <p class="lede">
              Messages arrive at Phishing Honeypots, get pulled apart header by
              header, and are written up one at a time — what the sender claimed,
              what the headers actually say, and how you'd catch it next time.
            </p>
            <div class="hero__actions">
              <a class="btn btn--lg" href="#samples">See a sample</a>
              <span class="hero__note">First write-ups in progress</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <figure class="card">
            <figcaption class="card__label">
              <span>Header analysis</span>
              <span class="badge">Example only</span>
            </figcaption>
            <pre class="card__body">Return-Path: &lt;bounce@<span class="hl">example-notabank.invalid</span>&gt;
Received: from mail-04.<span class="hl">example-notabank.invalid</span>
  by mx.gatemoss.com
Authentication-Results:
  spf=<span class="fail">fail</span> dkim=<span class="fail">none</span> dmarc=<span class="fail">fail</span>
From: "IT Service Desk" &lt;no-reply@<span class="hl">example-notabank.invalid</span>&gt;
Subject: Action required: sign-in verification</pre>
            <figcaption class="card__foot">
              Fictional message, written for this page. The display name claims
              to be internal IT; every authentication check fails and both sender
              fields sit on the same lookalike domain.
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="samples">
          <header class="section__head">
            <h2>Recent samples</h2>
            <span class="section__tag">Placeholder entries</span>
          </header>

          <ul class="samples">
            {
              samples.map((s) => (
                <li>
                  <span class="samples__id">{s.id}</span>
                  <span class="samples__family">{s.family}</span>
                  <span class="samples__host">{s.host}</span>
                  <span class={`tag tag--${s.verdict}`}>{s.verdict}</span>
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ul>
          <p class="note">
            Invented entries on reserved <code>.invalid</code> domains, defanged
            with brackets. Real catalogue to follow.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="method">
          <header class="section__head">
            <h2>Method</h2>
            <span class="section__tag">Draft copy</span>
          </header>
          <div class="cols">
            <article>
              <h3>Collection</h3>
              <p>
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.
                Vestibulum tincidunt mauris eu risus varius, non fermentum arcu
                porta. Sed auctor lectus quis sapien vehicula.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <h3>Analysis</h3>
              <p>
                Curabitur pretium tincidunt lacus. Nulla gravida orci a odio.
                Nullam varius, turpis et commodo pharetra, est eros bibendum
                elit, nec luctus magna felis sollicitudin mauris.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <h3>Write-up</h3>
              <p>
                Integer in mauris eu nibh euismod gravida. Duis ac tellus et
                risus vulputate vehicula. Donec lobortis risus a elit. Etiam
                tempor lorem non nisi.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="tooling">
          <header class="section__head">
            <h2>Tooling</h2>
            <span class="section__tag">Draft copy</span>
          </header>
          <div class="cols">
            <article>
              <h3>Triage</h3>
              <p>
                Praesent commodo cursus magna, vel scelerisque nisl consectetur
                et. Aenean lacinia bibendum nulla sed consectetur.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <h3>Corpus</h3>
              <p>
                Vivamus sagittis lacus vel augue laoreet rutrum faucibus dolor
                auctor. Maecenas faucibus mollis interdum.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <h3>Detection</h3>
              <p>
                Donec ullamcorper nulla non metus auctor fringilla. Cras mattis
                consectetur purus sit amet fermentum.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer>
        <span>gatemoss</span>
        <span>Independent research. Nothing here reflects any employer.</span>
      </footer>
    </div>

    <script>
      const topbar = document.getElementById("topbar");
      const links = Array.from(
        document.querySelectorAll(".nav__link")
      ) as HTMLAnchorElement[];
      const pill = document.getElementById("navPill");
      const container = document.getElementById("navLinks");

      // Condense the bar once the page has moved.
      const onScroll = () => {
        topbar?.classList.toggle("is-scrolled", window.scrollY > 24);
      };
      onScroll();
      window.addEventListener("scroll", onScroll, { passive: true });

      // Slide the pill to a given link.
      const movePill = (el: HTMLElement | null) => {
        if (!el || !pill) return;
        pill.style.opacity = "1";
        pill.style.width = `${el.offsetWidth}px`;
        pill.style.transform = `translateX(${el.offsetLeft}px)`;
      };

      let activeLink: HTMLElement | null = links[0] ?? null;

      links.forEach((link) => {
        link.addEventListener("mouseenter", () => movePill(link));
        link.addEventListener("focus", () => movePill(link));
      });
      container?.addEventListener("mouseleave", () => movePill(activeLink));

      // Track which section is in view.
      const sections = links
        .map((l) => document.getElementById(l.dataset.nav ?? ""))
        .filter((s): s is HTMLElement => Boolean(s));

      const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
        (entries) => {
          entries.forEach((entry) => {
            if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
            const match = links.find((l) => l.dataset.nav === entry.target.id);
            if (!match) return;
            links.forEach((l) => l.classList.remove("is-active"));
            match.classList.add("is-active");
            activeLink = match;
            movePill(match);
          });
        },
        { rootMargin: "-45% 0px -50% 0px" }
      );
      sections.forEach((s) => observer.observe(s));

      window.addEventListener("load", () => movePill(activeLink));
      window.addEventListener("resize", () => movePill(activeLink));
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --ink: #161c18;
    --moss: #3f5a44;
    --moss-bright: #4f7358;
    --lichen: #93a487;
    --paper: #e9e8de;
    --paper-raised: #f4f3ec;
    --oxide: #8c3a32;
    --amber: #8a6b21;

    --display: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif;
    --body: "Archivo", system-ui, sans-serif;
    --mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;

    --line: rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.14);
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-padding-top: 96px;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--body);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .shell {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 28px;
  }

  /* ---------- Top bar ---------- */
  .topbar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(233, 232, 222, 0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }
  .topbar.is-scrolled {
    border-bottom-color: var(--line);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px -14px rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.5);
  }

  .devstrip {
    background: var(--moss);
    color: var(--paper-raised);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-height: 40px;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease, opacity 0.25s ease;
  }
  .topbar.is-scrolled .devstrip {
    max-height: 0;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .devstrip__inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding-top: 9px;
    padding-bottom: 9px;
  }
  .devstrip__dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--paper-raised);
    flex: none;
    animation: blink 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes blink {
    0%,
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    50% {
      opacity: 0.3;
    }
  }

  .nav__inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
    height: 62px;
    transition: height 0.25s ease;
  }
  .topbar.is-scrolled .nav__inner {
    height: 54px;
  }

  .wordmark {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--moss);
    text-decoration: none;
    flex: none;
  }

  .nav__links {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-left: auto;
  }
  .nav__pill {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 0;
    height: 32px;
    margin-top: -16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(63, 90, 68, 0.12);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: transform 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
      width 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), opacity 0.2s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .nav__link {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    color: rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.66);
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 0.18s ease;
  }
  .nav__link:hover,
  .nav__link.is-active {
    color: var(--moss);
  }
  .nav__link.is-active {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .nav__link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--moss);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .btn {
    flex: none;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--moss);
    color: var(--paper-raised);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover {
    background: var(--moss-bright);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .btn:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--ink);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .btn--lg {
    padding: 13px 26px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 76px 0 92px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--moss);
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 6.6vw, 4.7rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--moss);
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.07rem;
    max-width: 44ch;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    color: rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.76);
  }
  .hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hero__note {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--lichen);
  }

  /* ---------- Card ---------- */
  .card {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -28px rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.55);
  }
  .card__label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--moss);
    padding: 13px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .badge {
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(140, 58, 50, 0.1);
    color: var(--oxide);
  }
  .card__body {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 22px 20px;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
    color: rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.82);
  }
  .card__body .hl {
    color: var(--oxide);
    background: rgba(140, 58, 50, 0.1);
  }
  .card__body .fail {
    color: var(--oxide);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .card__foot {
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: 15px 20px 19px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.6);
  }

  /* ---------- Sections ---------- */
  .section {
    padding: 0 0 88px;
  }
  .section__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section__head h2 {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--moss);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .section__tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lichen);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(147, 164, 135, 0.7);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 2px 9px;
  }

  .samples {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .samples li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 118px 1fr 1fr auto;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 17px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.1);
    transition: background 0.18s ease;
  }
  .samples li:hover {
    background: var(--paper-raised);
  }
  .samples__id,
  .samples__host {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .samples__id {
    color: var(--lichen);
  }
  .samples__host {
    color: rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.58);
  }
  .samples__family {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .tag--malicious {
    color: var(--oxide);
  }
  .tag--suspicious {
    color: var(--amber);
  }
  .tag--inconclusive {
    color: var(--lichen);
  }
  .note {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--lichen);
    margin: 16px 0 0;
  }
  .note code {
    background: rgba(63, 90, 68, 0.1);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 36px;
  }
  .cols h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .cols p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: rgba(22, 28, 24, 0.6);
  }

  footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 26px 0 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--lichen);
  }

  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 42px;
      padding: 54px 0 68px;
    }
    .cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .samples li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      row-gap: 6px;
    }
    .samples__host {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .nav__inner {
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .nav__links {
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      margin-left: 0;
    }
    .nav__links::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }
    .nav__inner > .btn {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    html {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }
    *,
    *::before,
    *::after {
      animation: none !important;
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>